; pratibimba — rendering / making-manifest
; the parent of all renderers.
; the same resonance made visible/audible through different media.
; each child renderer is a bridge from graph energy to its target form.

(bhasha pratibimba
  (swarupa naada)
  (phala spanda)
  (sthita domain-language)
  (yukta strudel music-ir resonance-ir raylib pratibimba-setu))
